# Cursor Rules Compatibility Pointer

Repository rules and domain guidelines are defined in `.cursor/rules/`.
Canonical cross-agent instructions are located in `.ai/AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md`.

Before modifying files, always read:
1. `.ai/AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md`
2. `.ai/PROJECT_STATE.md`
3. `.ai/DECISIONS.md`
4. `.ai/TASKS.md`
